1
00:00:00,612 --> 00:00:04,202
(Howard:)Sheldon, don't take this the wrong way,
but you're insane.

2
00:00:05,117 --> 00:00:09,207
(Leonard:)That may well be, but the fact is it
wouldn't kill us to meet some new people.

3
00:00:09,371 --> 00:00:12,291
(Sheldon:)For the record,
it could kill us to meet new people.

4
00:00:13,917 --> 00:00:17,917
(Sheldon:)They could be murderers
or the carriers of unusual pathogens.

5
00:00:18,422 --> 00:00:21,882
(Sheldon:)And I'm not insane.
My mother had me tested.

6
00:00:25,304 --> 00:00:28,144
(Leonard:)If we do get a new friend,
he should be a guy you can trust.

7
00:00:28,307 --> 00:00:30,137
You know, a guy who has your back.

8
00:00:30,309 --> 00:00:33,979
He should have money and live in a cool
place by the beach where we throw parties.

9
00:00:34,146 --> 00:00:38,316
- He should share our love of technology.
- And he should know a lot of women.

10
00:00:38,650 --> 00:00:41,690
Okay, let's see, money, women, technology.
Okay, we're agreed.

11
00:00:41,862 --> 00:00:45,492
(Leonard:)Our new friend is going to be Iron Man.

12
00:00:48,494 --> 00:00:50,534
RAJESH [SINGING]:
I can go all night

13
00:00:50,704 --> 00:00:53,164
If you know what I mean

14
00:00:53,332 --> 00:00:56,082
(Raj:)Welcome to the Raj Mahal.

15
00:00:56,585 --> 00:00:58,335
Yes, it's very nice. Good night, Raj.

16
00:00:58,504 --> 00:01:00,504
(Raj:)- Wait, the evening's not over.
- Yes, it is.

